    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 3.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif þonne se frigea ðy dæge wyrce butan his hlafordes hæse, þolie his freotes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, a freeman works on that day without his lord’s command, let him pay with his freedom.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If, however, a freeman works on that day, except by his lord's command, he shall be reduced to slavery, or [pay a fine of] 60 shillings. A priest shall pay a double fine.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif þonne se frigea ðy dæge wyrce buton his hlafordes hæse, þolige his freotes [oþþe LX scll'; ⁊ preost twy-sceildig].</ab>
      </div>
